  "version": "0.14.1-alpha.3",
  "notes": "> **⚠️ Important notice for users on 0.14.0-alpha.9 – 0.14.0**: these versions have a bug that prevents automatic updates from completing. Please open `https://uniclipboard.app/download` in your browser, download the latest installer, and reinstall manually.\n\n## 0.14.1-alpha.3 - 2026-06-10\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Release note links and manual download buttons now open in the system browser instead of navigating away from the updater window or doing nothing in portable builds.\n- Windows update installs no longer fail after stopping the background service on non-English systems, and no longer show repeated console windows while doing so.\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n> **⚠️ 重要公告（0.14.0-alpha.9 ~ 0.14.0 用户）**：这些版本存在自动更新缺陷，点击安装后无法完成更新。请在浏览器中打开 `https://uniclipboard.app/download`，手动下载最新安装包覆盖安装。\n\n## 0.14.1-alpha.3 - 2026-06-10\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 发布说明链接和手动下载按钮现在会在系统浏览器中打开，不再让更新窗口跳转到外部页面，也不会在便携版中无响应。\n- Windows 在非英文系统上安装更新时，不再因为停止后台服务后的状态判断出错而失败，也不会在这个过程中反复弹出控制台窗口。",
